    "text_full": "Toggle navigation\nSearch\nDONATE\nHome\n \nExplanation\n \nAnswering Myths\n \nVideos\n \nEmail Your Legislator\n \nLetter-to-Editor\n \nVolunteer\n \nMedia\n \nAbout\n \nEvents\n\nState status: AK AL AR AZ CA CO CT DC DE FL GA HI IA ID IL IN KS KY LA MA MD ME MI MN MO MS MT NC ND NE NH NJ NM NV NY OH OK OR PA RI SC SD TN TX UT VA VT WA WI WV WY\n\nDonate\n\nPlease Donate to National Popular Vote\n\nActBlue Express using credit card or Pay Pal\n\nDonate by Paypal\n\nDonate via Donately \n\nMailing address for checks: \n\nNational Popular Vote\nBox 1441\nLos Altos, CA 94023\ne-mail us\n\nIn addition to authoring the National Popular Vote Interstate Compact, we are the only group that employs national and local representatives, on a year-round basis, to meet with state legislators, officials, voters, organizations, and the media in order to enact the Compact into law. We try to meet with virtually every state legislator and also meet with the numerous people and organizations that influence them. We also engage in public relations efforts. The National Popular Vote organization is a non-profit corporation. We can't do these things without supporters like you. National Popular Vote is a 501(c)(4) non profit corporation. Contributions to National Popular Vote are not tax-deductible for federal income tax purposes.\n\n \n\n \n\nInstitute for Research on Presidential Elections\n\nTax-deductible contributions to the Institute for Research on Presidential Elections, a 501(c)(3) non profit corporation, may be made by check, and sent to\nInstitute for Research on Presidential Elections\nBox 1441\nLos Altos, CA 94023\n\n \n\nThe national popular vote winner should become President\nOne-person, one-vote\nCandidates should have a reason to campaign in all 50 states"
}